1
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:51,000
Badland is a western film directed by Justin Lee.

2
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Detective Matthias Breecher, hired to track down the worst of the
Confederate war criminals, roams the Old West seeking justice.

3
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:21,000
His resolve is tested when he meets a determined pioneer
woman who is far more than she seems.

4
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
Reginald Cooke, played by Bruce Dern.

5
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:51,000
Sarah Cooke, played by Mira Sorvino.

6
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
Matthias Breecher, played by Kevin Makely.

7
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Huxley Wainwright, played by Jeff Fahey.

8
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Harlan Red, played by Wes Studi.

9
01:27:45,000 --> 01:27:51,000
Senator Benjamin Burke, played by Tony Todd.

10
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
Badland is a 2019 American Western film set more than a
decade after the American Civil War.

11
01:47:15,000 --> 01:47:21,000
Written and directed by Justin Lee, it depicts a Pinkerton detective who has been sent west to find
several former Confederate soldiers who committed atrocious acts during the Civil War.
